required+cert -> required+cert: client cert (true DER)
required+none -> refused
required+wrong -> refused
optional+cert -> optional+cert: client cert (true DER)
optional+none -> optional+none: no client cert
no CA: tls: client authentication needs a client CA
junk CA: tls: no certificates found in the root certificate PEM
no key: tls: a client certificate needs its private key
no roots: tls: no trusted root certificates
system roots: true
system roots -> system roots: no client cert
